4
00:00:33,163 --> 00:00:36,514
WINDOWS ARE ALL BOARDED UP.WITNESSES SAID THREE MEN
TOOK PART IN THE ABDUCTION.

5
00:00:36,514 --> 00:00:39,430
SO FIGURE THOSE THREE INSIDE
PLUS A COUPLE MORE JUST FOR FUN.

6
00:00:39,430 --> 00:00:41,432
THIS IS MIA WESTLAKE.

7
00:00:41,432 --> 00:00:45,175
I WANT EVERYBODY TO TAKE
ANOTHER GOOD, LONG LOOK.

8
00:00:45,175 --> 00:00:47,873
WE HAVE EVERY REASON TO BELIEVE
THE KIDNAPPER'S GOT HER ALIVE

9
00:00:47,873 --> 00:00:49,658
IN THERE, SO BE CAREFUL.

10
00:00:49,658 --> 00:00:52,487
ME, HICKS AND MARTINEZ
TAKE THE FRONT DOOR.

11
00:00:52,487 --> 00:00:54,402
DYSON AND SHELLY,
YOU TAKE THE TWO-THREE CORNER.

12
00:00:54,402 --> 00:00:58,188
BUCCI, PAULSON AND FREDERICKS,
YOU TAKE THE THREE-FOUR.

13
00:00:58,188 --> 00:01:00,538
LET'S GO.[guns cock]

14
00:01:18,295 --> 00:01:19,862
[whispers] READY.

15
00:01:19,862 --> 00:01:21,429
READY.

16
00:01:21,429 --> 00:01:24,214
[lowers voice]
THREE, TWO, ONE.

17
00:01:24,214 --> 00:01:26,086
STAY WHERE YOU ARE! FBI!

18
00:01:26,086 --> 00:01:28,914
DOWN! GET DOWN![shouting indistinctly]

19
00:01:28,914 --> 00:01:32,266
GET DOWN! GET DOWN![all shouting at once]

20
00:01:32,266 --> 00:01:34,485
GET DOWN!

21
00:01:34,485 --> 00:01:38,402
JANE?

22
00:01:38,402 --> 00:01:41,144
LISBON?
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

23
00:01:41,144 --> 00:01:42,798
