24
00:01:49,109 --> 00:01:53,504
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?YOU'RE WAVING YOUR GUNS AROUND,
IS WHAT YOU'RE DOING.

25
00:01:53,504 --> 00:01:57,073
CAN YOU JUST
PUT YOUR GUNS AWAY, PLEASE?

26
00:01:57,073 --> 00:01:58,988
COWBOYS!

27
00:02:01,556 --> 00:02:11,696
♪♪

28
00:02:11,696 --> 00:02:14,438
SIR, THE IMPORTANT THING
IS NOBODY GOT HURT.

29
00:02:14,438 --> 00:02:16,745
ALL RESPECT
TO YOUR PEOPLE, LISBON,

30
00:02:16,745 --> 00:02:18,747
THE IMPORTANT THING IS
WE MAKE SURE

31
00:02:18,747 --> 00:02:20,662
THAT THIS DOES NOT
HAPPEN AGAIN.

32
00:02:20,662 --> 00:02:23,099
"CBI AGENTS SHOOT EACH OTHER"

33
00:02:23,099 --> 00:02:25,754
IS NOT A HEADLINE
THAT I WANT TO SEE.

34
00:02:25,754 --> 00:02:27,756
WE CAME IN HOT

35
00:02:27,756 --> 00:02:31,325
BECAUSE WE THOUGHT
THE KIDNAP VICTIM WAS THERE.MIA SOMEBODY.

36
00:02:31,325 --> 00:02:33,631
MIA WESTLAKE.
MARIN COUNTY HEIRESS.MIA WESTLAKE.

37
00:02:33,631 --> 00:02:36,199
SHE WAS TAKEN
A DAY AND A HALF AGO.

38
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:38,332
WITNESS GAVE US A PARTIAL PLATE
ON THE KIDNAPPER'S CAR.

39
00:02:38,332 --> 00:02:41,030
WE DUG UP AN OUTSTANDING
PARKING TICKET

40
00:02:41,030 --> 00:02:42,945
TO A CAR IN OAKLAND,
CHECKED THE ADDRESS,

41
00:02:42,945 --> 00:02:45,556
FOUND THERE WERE PEOPLE
INSIDE A HOUSE

42
00:02:45,556 --> 00:02:48,994
THAT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE EMPTY.AND HE FOUND
YOU THERE BECAUSE?

43
00:02:48,994 --> 00:02:50,909
WE GOT A CALL FROM
THE CORONER'S BUREAU.

44
00:02:50,909 --> 00:02:53,216
THERE WAS A REPORT
OF A CORPSE IN A HOUSE.

45
00:02:53,216 --> 00:02:55,305
BUT THEY WERE SHORTHANDED--
BUDGET CUTS--

46
00:02:55,305 --> 00:02:57,307
SO THEY ASKED US
TO GO AND CHECK IT OUT.

47
00:02:57,307 --> 00:02:59,788
MY TEAM WENT IN THE HOUSE.
THE CORPSE WAS THERE

48
00:02:59,788 --> 00:03:02,225
BUT THE CORONER WASN'T,
SO WE WAITED.

49
00:03:02,225 --> 00:03:04,358
AND EVERYONE ALMOST DIED
IN A HAIL OF BULLETS.

50
00:03:04,358 --> 00:03:07,012
WHERE ARE YOU WITH WESTLAKE?

51
00:03:07,012 --> 00:03:08,971
WE'RE SET UP
INSIDE THE HOUSE.

52
00:03:08,971 --> 00:03:11,147
WE'RE WAITING
FOR A RANSOM DEMAND.

53
00:03:11,147 --> 00:03:13,671
WHAT'S WITH THE CORPSE?A YOUNG MALE DEAD
THREE TO FIVE YEARS.

54
00:03:13,671 --> 00:03:16,283
CORONER COULDN'T BE SPECIFIC.

55
00:03:16,283 --> 00:03:18,894
THERE WERE TWO BULLET HOLES
IN THE BASE OF THE SKULL.

56
00:03:18,894 --> 00:03:21,505
IT WAS WRAPPED IN PLASTIC
AND STORED IN A WINDOW SEAT.DO YOU HAVE AN I.D.?

57
00:03:21,505 --> 00:03:24,943
NOT YET.YES YET.
CORONER'S REPORT JUST CAME IN,

58
00:03:24,943 --> 00:03:28,295
AND THE CORPSE IS...
COLIN HAYMER.

59
00:03:28,295 --> 00:03:31,341
HAYMER? WHY DO I
RECOGNIZE THAT NAME?

60
00:03:31,341 --> 00:03:34,214
COLIN HAYMER WAS A KIDNAP VICTIM
THREE YEARS AGO.

61
00:03:34,214 --> 00:03:37,217
EARLY 20s FROM SAN FRANCISCO,
WEALTHY FAMILY.

62
00:03:37,217 --> 00:03:41,438
S.F.P.D. HANDLED THE CASE.
FAMILY PAID THE RANSOM.THAT DIDN'T WORK.

63
00:03:41,438 --> 00:03:43,614
EERILY SIMILAR TO YOUR
KIDNAPPING, DON'T YOU THINK?

64
00:03:43,614 --> 00:03:46,313
WHO WANTS TO BET COLIN HAYMER'S
KIDNAPPER'S THE SAME KIDNAPPERS

65
00:03:46,313 --> 00:03:50,360
THAT KIDNAPPED MIA WESTLAKE?WELL, COULD BE A COINCIDENCE.

66
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,406
THERE ARE NO COINCIDENCES.

67
00:03:52,406 --> 00:03:55,147
I AGREE. I WANT YOUR PEOPLE
TEAMING UP ON THIS.

68
00:03:55,147 --> 00:03:58,716
[sighs] IS THAT NECESSARY?I BELIEVE IT IS.

69
00:03:58,716 --> 00:04:02,372
I WANT TO FOSTER BETTER
INTER-UNIT RELATIONS.

70
00:04:02,372 --> 00:04:06,768
LET'S STOP STUMBLING INTO EACH
OTHER AND TRY WORKING TOGETHER.

71
00:04:06,768 --> 00:04:09,510
YOU HAVE CONCERNS.

72
00:04:09,510 --> 00:04:10,859
I DO.

73
00:04:10,859 --> 00:04:13,296
THIS MAN IS A... A...

74
00:04:13,296 --> 00:04:15,951
I-I DON'T EVEN KNOW
WHAT HE IS.

75
00:04:15,951 --> 00:04:18,170
HE'S AN ACCIDENT
WAITING TO HAPPEN.

76
00:04:18,170 --> 00:04:21,304
SAM, BE FAIR. HE--CLOSES CASES, I KNOW.

77
00:04:21,304 --> 00:04:23,480
I DO.HE DOES.

78
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,439
I DO.

79
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:29,269
IN MY OPINION,
THIS IS A MISTAKE.

80
00:04:29,269 --> 00:04:31,096
WE'RE ALL AGREED THEN.

81
00:04:31,096 --> 00:04:32,881
[sighs deeply]

82
00:04:32,881 --> 00:04:36,406
OFF YOU GO.

83
00:04:36,406 --> 00:04:39,017
MIA WESTLAKE WAS
ABDUCTED 38 HOURS AGO

84
00:04:39,017 --> 00:04:41,324
COMING HOME
FROM A GALLERY OPENING.

85
00:04:41,324 --> 00:04:44,414
THANK YOU, REBECCA.

86
00:04:44,414 --> 00:04:47,548
UH, YOU NEED ANYTHING ELSE?NO, WE'RE GOOD. THANK YOU.

87
00:04:47,548 --> 00:04:51,552
THIS IS COPIES
OF THE CASE PAPERWORK SO FAR.

88
00:04:51,552 --> 00:04:55,556
NOW THE KIDNAPPERS FORCED
HER CAR OFF THE ROAD,

89
00:04:55,556 --> 00:04:57,297
KILLED THE DRIVER
AND THEN TOOK HER.

90
00:04:57,297 --> 00:04:59,255
WHY KILL THE DRIVER?

91
00:04:59,255 --> 00:05:01,823
IT'S A MESSAGE. THEY WON'T
HESITATE TO KILL THE HOSTAGE

92
00:05:01,823 --> 00:05:04,391
IF THEY DON'T GET
WHAT THEY WANT.YES.

93
00:05:04,391 --> 00:05:07,307
THERE'S NO RANSOM DEMAND YET.

94
00:05:07,307 --> 00:05:11,485
HOW DO WE KNOW
IT'S A KIDNAPPING?THEY SENT THE FAMILY A PROOF
OF LIFE A FEW HOURS LATER.

95
00:05:11,485 --> 00:05:14,009
NO BLINDFOLD. THAT'S NOT GOOD.
MEANS THEY DON'T CARE

96
00:05:14,009 --> 00:05:16,620
IF SHE SEES ANYTHING.GOOD THINKING, BERT.

97
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:19,580
WHAT'S YOUR PROBLEM?NO PROBLEM.

98
00:05:19,580 --> 00:05:21,582
[Lisbon] HEY.RIGSBY'S CORRECT.

99
00:05:21,582 --> 00:05:23,932
THIS IS SHAPING UP TO END
LIKE THE HAYMER ABDUCTION.

100
00:05:23,932 --> 00:05:26,891
LET'S MAKE SURE
THAT IT DOESN'T.

101
00:05:26,891 --> 00:05:30,199
ALL RIGHT, I GOTTA GET BACK
TO THE WESTLAKES'.I'D LIKE TO COME WITH
IF THAT'S ALL RIGHT.

102
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:32,723
I'D LIKE TO ASK
THE WESTLAKES SOME QUESTIONS

103
00:05:32,723 --> 00:05:35,247
ABOUT OUR DEAD GUY,
SEE IF THERE'S ANY CONNECTION.[Bosco] OKAY.

104
00:05:35,247 --> 00:05:38,207
START DIGGING
ON THE HAYMER CASE.

105
00:05:38,207 --> 00:05:40,296
CONTACT THE FAMILY,
SET UP INTERVIEWS.AND I'D LIKE TO LEAVE HICKS
HERE TO WORK WITH YOUR TEAM.

106
00:05:40,296 --> 00:05:41,906
THAT'S ALL RIGHT WITH YOU?
KEEP 'EM HONEST.[Lisbon] OKAY.

107
00:05:41,906 --> 00:05:44,779
[Van Pelt] HEY.[Rigsby] WHAT DID HE SAY?

108
00:05:44,779 --> 00:05:48,522
[Lisbon]
CARE TO REFRAME THAT, SAM?NO. THEY'RE JANE'S PEOPLE.
THEY NEED WATCHING.

109
00:05:48,522 --> 00:05:51,263
I LIKE TO THINK OF THEM
AS MYPEOPLE.WELL, THINK WHAT YOU LIKE.

110
00:05:51,263 --> 00:05:54,266
I CAN'T HAVE THEM TRYING TO PULL
SOME CHEAP STUNT BEHIND MY BACK.

111
00:05:54,266 --> 00:05:57,269
WELL, WE HAVE A WHOLE RANGE
OF EXPENSIVE STUNTS

112
00:05:57,269 --> 00:06:01,361
IF YOU DON'T LIKE
THE CHEAP ONES.I UNDERSTAND YOUR ISSUE,
AGENT BOSCO.

113
00:06:01,361 --> 00:06:04,364
NO PROBLEM. WELCOME, HICKS.[Van Pelt] BOSS.

114
00:06:04,364 --> 00:06:06,366
WE'LL EXTEND EVERY COURTESY.

115
00:06:08,542 --> 00:06:10,718
LET'S GET STARTED,
SHALL WE?

116
00:06:12,763 --> 00:06:15,636
[police radio chatter]

117
