00:34:55,310 --> 00:34:58,226
NOT PLAYING WITH
"STAR WARS" TOYS.OH, MY GOD. WHO?

651
00:34:58,226 --> 00:35:00,620
COME HERE.

652
00:35:00,620 --> 00:35:02,839
[transmitter beeps]

653
00:35:11,239 --> 00:35:12,240
HER.

654
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:14,677
YOU BITCH!

655
00:35:14,677 --> 00:35:16,853
WHAT? JEEZ![man] WHAT--
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

656
00:35:16,853 --> 00:35:20,727
YOU CRAZY BITCH![all shouting at once]

657
00:35:23,991 --> 00:35:25,993
I'M GONNA KILL YOU![all shouting at once]

658
00:35:25,993 --> 00:35:30,084
HOLD IT DOWN! NO, NO!
HOLD IT DOWN!

659
00:35:30,084 --> 00:35:31,825
[Verona and Belinda shouting]

660
00:35:31,825 --> 00:35:33,827
MY MONEY'S ON VERONA.

661
00:35:33,827 --> 00:35:35,829
SANDBORNE'S GOT HER
ON EXPERIENCE,

662
00:35:35,829 --> 00:35:39,049
BUT IT'S HARD TO BEAT
THAT KIND OF ENTHUSIASM.

663
00:35:39,049 --> 00:35:41,965
WHOA.GOT THE IMAGE UP.

664
00:35:41,965 --> 00:35:44,359
[Verona and Belinda
continuing shouting]

665
00:35:44,359 --> 00:35:46,753
NOBODY.THERE WILL BE.

666
00:35:46,753 --> 00:35:49,582
SOMEBODY BETTER COME.

667
00:35:51,932 --> 00:35:55,631
IF NOBODY DOES,
YOU JUST KILLED MIA WESTLAKE.

668
00:35:55,631 --> 00:35:58,156
BLAME, BLAME, BLAME, BLAME,
BLAME. SOMEBODY'S COMING.

669
00:35:58,156 --> 00:36:00,941
DON'T WORRY.
AND THERE THEY ARE.

670
00:36:00,941 --> 00:36:03,335
HELLO, MRS. KENT.

671
00:36:06,990 --> 00:36:08,775
SHOULD WE GO GET HER?

672
00:36:08,775 --> 00:36:11,343
NO. WAIT.

673
00:36:27,489 --> 00:36:29,361
[starts engine]

674
00:36:39,936 --> 00:36:42,287
MONEY'S ON ITS WAY.
IT'S CLEAN.

675
00:36:42,287 --> 00:36:44,985
THEY TRIED PLANTING A TRACKER,
BUT I CAUGHT IT.

676
00:36:44,985 --> 00:36:47,553
GET THE GIRL READY.[Lisbon]
HANDS WHERE I CAN SEE 'EM!

677
00:36:47,553 --> 00:36:50,686
[Bosco] HANDS! HANDS!WHAT'S GOING ON?

678
00:36:50,686 --> 00:36:54,212
DON'T MOVE. DON'T DO ANYTHING
UNLESS I TELL YOU TO.I DON'T UNDERSTAND.
THE BABY IS SLEEPING.

679
00:36:54,212 --> 00:36:56,910
OH, THE BABY. SHE'S BEEN
WANDERING AROUND THE HOUSE

680
00:36:56,910 --> 00:37:00,827
LIKE A LITTLE LOST LAMB.
YOU'RE JUST A TERRIBLE NANNY.

681
00:37:00,827 --> 00:37:02,916
WHO WERE YOU TALKING TO
ON THE PHONE?

682
00:37:02,916 --> 00:37:05,092
MY SISTER.IS SHE A KIDNAPPER, TOO?

683
00:37:05,092 --> 00:37:08,095
NO!WHAT'S THIS?

684
00:37:08,095 --> 00:37:11,707
LET ME GO.
LET US HAVE THE MONEY.

685
00:37:11,707 --> 00:37:13,448
THE GIRL MIGHT LIVE.

686
00:37:13,448 --> 00:37:17,191
PUT YOUR HANDS
BEHIND YOUR BACK.

687
00:37:17,191 --> 00:37:19,237
YOU ARE MAKING
A BAD MISTAKE.

688
00:37:19,237 --> 00:37:22,936
IF YOU PEOPLE
DON'T LET ME GO RIGHT NOW,

689
00:37:22,936 --> 00:37:24,503
MIA WESTLAKE
WILL BE TORTURED TO DEATH

690
00:37:24,503 --> 00:37:26,940
IF THEY THINK YOU'VE DONE
ANYTHING TO ME.

691
00:37:26,940 --> 00:37:28,985
NO, THEY WON'T.
WE'RE GONNA GO GET HER.

692
00:37:28,985 --> 00:37:31,901
GOOD LUCK FINDING HER.

693
00:37:31,901 --> 00:37:34,034
WE DON'T NEED LUCK.

694
00:37:34,034 --> 00:37:36,645
LET'S GO.

695
00:37:39,953 --> 00:37:44,610
CHECKING...
LAST NUMBER CALLED.

696
00:37:44,610 --> 00:37:48,744
767-555-0131.[typing on keyboard]

697
00:37:50,920 --> 00:37:52,705
IT'S A LANDLINE.

698
00:37:52,705 --> 00:37:55,142
[tapping keys]

699
00:37:56,796 --> 00:38:00,626
1867 CLIFF POINT CIRCLE,
OAKLAND.

700
00:38:00,626 --> 00:38:03,933
CALL OAKLAND P.D. TELL THEM
WE'RE TAKING THE HOUSE.

701
00:38:40,318 --> 00:38:42,929
[explosions]

702
00:38:42,929 --> 00:38:45,584
GET DOWN! DROP YOUR WEAPONS![man] GET DOWN!

703
00:38:45,584 --> 00:38:49,370
[indistinct shouting, gunfire]

704
00:39:09,956 --> 00:39:12,698
[Mia crying]MIA!

705
00:39:18,356 --> 00:39:21,010
[both crying]

706
00:39:47,036 --> 00:39:49,865
THOUGHT I WOULD RESURRECT
AN OLD TEQUILA TRADITION.

707
00:39:49,865 --> 00:39:52,041
I'M IN.

708
00:39:52,041 --> 00:39:53,391
CHEERS.

709
00:39:58,265 --> 00:39:59,919
SMOOTH.

710
00:39:59,919 --> 00:40:02,051
YES, IT IS.

711
00:40:02,051 --> 00:40:04,489
[puts glass on table]

712
00:40:04,489 --> 00:40:06,708
SO AM I SOMEONE
YOU KNOW NOW?

713
00:40:06,708 --> 00:40:09,842
I'M STARTING
TO RECOGNIZE YOU, YEAH.

714
00:40:09,842 --> 00:40:11,887
YOU KNOW THAT THING YOU SAID

715
00:40:11,887 --> 00:40:16,065
ABOUT JANE MAKING YOU A BETTER
COP--YOU DON'T BELIEVE THAT.

716
00:40:16,065 --> 00:40:19,591
I MAY HAVE EXAGGERATED
FOR EFFECT.

717
00:40:19,591 --> 00:40:22,420
ANYWAY, I WANTED TO SAY

718
00:40:22,420 --> 00:40:25,423
THAT IT'S BEEN NICE
WORKING WITH YOU AGAIN.

719
00:40:25,423 --> 00:40:28,861
YOU, TOO.

720
00:40:36,782 --> 00:40:39,480
ANYHOW...

721
00:40:41,613 --> 00:40:43,179
GOOD NIGHT.

722
00:40:43,179 --> 00:40:45,355
GOOD NIGHT.

723
00:41:01,459 --> 00:41:04,505
I'VE BEEN THINKING.

724
00:41:04,505 --> 00:41:06,072
OH?

725
00:41:06,072 --> 00:41:08,770
YOU'RE NOT A COP.

726
00:41:08,770 --> 00:41:10,206
MNH-MNH.

727
00:41:10,206 --> 00:41:12,818
YOU NEVER WILL BE.MNH-MNH.

728
00:41:12,818 --> 00:41:15,690
BUT YOU HAVE A...
USEFUL PERSPECTIVE.

729
00:41:20,347 --> 00:41:23,176
THIS IS A SUMMARY
OF THE RED JOHN CASE

730
00:41:23,176 --> 00:41:25,047
SINCE I TOOK OVER.

731
00:41:38,321 --> 00:41:41,977
TAKE A LOOK.
TELL ME WHAT YOU THINK.

732
00:41:43,805 --> 00:41:45,241
BOSCO.

733
00:41:45,241 --> 00:41:47,592
DON'T THANK ME.I WASN'T GOING TO.

734
00:41:47,592 --> 00:41:50,769
I NEED THE ACTUAL CASE FILE--

735
00:41:50,769 --> 00:41:53,075
UNABRIDGED.

736
00:41:55,208 --> 00:41:58,385
YOU'RE A JERK.
YOU KNOW THAT?

737
00:42:05,566 --> 00:42:08,047
NIGHT, BOSCO.

738
00:42:16,272 --> 00:42:19,058
STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

